{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03421","headline":"唐都尉山池 · 崔湜","name":"唐都尉山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲渚扬轻舟，前谿钓晚流。\n鴈翻蒲叶起，鱼拨荇花游。\n金子悬湘柚，珠房折海榴。\n幽寻惜未已，清月半西楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}